CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786551523
OL,3,CMum's 'sleepless nights' over possible
OL,4,Cearly release of shatter blast killer
OL,6,FShe told ITV Tyne Tees: "We are having
OL,7,Fsleepless nights over this because we
OL,8,Fare thinking Archie's killer could be
OL,9,Fout.
OL,11,F"To hear that he could only be doing
OL,12,Fseven years for killing my son is
OL,13,Fsickening."
OL,15,FThe comments add to criticism of the
OL,16,Fpolicy from other bereaved families
OL,17,Flike PC Andrew Harper's, who was
OL,18,Fkilled while responding to a quad bike
OL,19,Ftheft in 2019.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,395,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786551523
OL,3,CMum's 'sleepless nights' over possible
OL,4,Cearly release of shatter blast killer
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has now
OL,7,Fsaid he is "determined" to ensure that
OL,8,Fcriminals in these particular cases
OL,9,Fserve their full sentence.
OL,11,FHe said: "I fully appreciate the
OL,12,Fanguish of Andrew's family and, more
OL,13,Fbroadly, of all those victims and
OL,14,Ftheir families who may see those who
OL,15,Fcaused them such harm not serve their
OL,16,Ffull sentence.
OL,18,F"It is incumbent on me as Prime
OL,19,FMinister to do everything within my
OL,20,Fpower to minimise that possibility.
OL,21,FAnd I am determined to do so."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,395,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786551523
OL,3,CMum's 'sleepless nights' over possible
OL,4,Cearly release of shatter blast killer
OL,6,FMr Burnham added: "I have asked the
OL,7,FJustice Secretary to fast-track the
OL,8,Fdevelopment of a plan for presentation
OL,9,Fto Parliament early next month to
OL,10,Fcreate more headroom within the prison
OL,11,Fsystem."
OL,13,FIn response to the PM's comments, Ms
OL,14,FErrington told ITV Tyne Tees she is
OL,15,Fglad the PM is listening to families
OL,16,Flike hers - but that acting on their
OL,17,Fcalls is a different matter.
OL,19,F"I'm glad he's listening, but he needs
OL,20,Fto do something," she said.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
