PN,39405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786551523
OL,3,CMum's 'sleepless nights' over possible
OL,4,Cearly release of shatter blast killer
OL,6,FGalbraith, of Rectory Road, Gateshead,
OL,7,FTyne and Wear, pleaded guilty to two
OL,8,Fcounts of manslaughter as well as
OL,9,Fpossessing and supplying cannabis.
OL,11,FThe explosion, on Violet Close in
OL,12,FBenwell, Newcastle, also killed
OL,13,FGalbraith's friend Jason 'Jay' Laws,
OL,14,Fwho had also been using the flat as a
OL,15,Fdrugs lab to produce 'shatter'
OL,16,Fcannabis.
OL,18,FGalbraith was jailed for 14 years in
OL,19,FMay last year at Newcastle Crown Court.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
