OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,395,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786551523
OL,3,CMum's 'sleepless nights' over possible
OL,4,Cearly release of shatter blast killer
OL,6,FThe court heard the explosion in
OL,7,FOctober 2024 destroyed six out of the
OL,8,F12 flats in the block and was followed
OL,9,Fby a "fierce fire" that caused so much
OL,10,Fdamage the whole block has since been
OL,11,Fdemolished.
OL,13,FPolice investigating the explosion
OL,14,Fdiscovered that the flat operated by
OL,15,FGalbraith and Laws was used as a
OL,16,F"drugs lab" to produce cannabis
OL,17,Fconcentrates, known as 'shatter' or
OL,18,F'butane honey oil', in a highly
OL,19,Fdangerous process.
OL,26,@qD@FOUqD@RO]xD@AOUxD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
